    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A FREE Prologue to Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code, a turn-based RPG indie title inspired by Xenogears and Shin Megami Tensei. Play as Joshwa as he helps an ex-Judge let go of his past. Battle beasts with mechanical parts using elemental and divine magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Prologue is an introduction to the full game, Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code. It takes place one day before the events of the full game. It will take about 1-2 hours to complete. Playing this Prologue will give you a good taste of what to expect for Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005350/extras/9e989da38fca5ab00f71b263772a0254.avif?t=1754918828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
